firefox-addons:2858219.description:
Stop using weak passwords and never leave your browser to generate a secure one. This powerful yet simple tool lets you create highly secure, random passwords right where you need them - directly in your browser toolbar.
Total Control & Customization
Tailor your passwords to meet any website's requirements. Choose from:
- Uppercase Letters (A-Z);
- Lowercase Letters (a-z);
- Numbers (0-9);
- Special Symbols (@, #, $, %, etc.);
- Password Length;
- Generate Multiple Passwords at once.
Privacy by Design
Your security is our priority. This extension contains no ads, no trackers, and does not collect any data. All password generation happens locally on your device. Your passwords are never sent over the internet, ensuring they remain known only to you.
One-Click Copy
Simply click on the generated password to copy it to your clipboard instantly. No hassle, no extra steps - just secure and efficient workflow.
Open Source & Transparent
Trust is key in security. The complete source code is publicly available on GitHub for everyone to review, audit, and verify.
Boost your online security in seconds. Install now!
